s', '_type': '_doc', '_id': 'fb47040d-7e9e-4b59-aa9a-3a83f71ef97e', 'status': 404, 'error': {'type': 'index_not_found_exception', 'reason': 'no such index [rcahmw_resources]', 'index_uuid': '4UoPqYUbTbOhxxsTW-tO1Q', 'index': 'rcahmw_resources'}, 'data': {'displaydescription': 'The site of a former field gate, now represented only by two iron posts either side of the trackway. The posts are up to 1 metre high and stamped ?Boulton & Paul, Norwich?. They were designed to be used with bespoke wire fencing.  There are other posts of this type in the wider area, and it seems that they represent early attempts to fence the mountain pastures when the land was held by the Derry Ormond estate in late Victorian or Edwardian times.  R.P. Sambrook, Trysor, 27 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': 'fb47040d-7e9e-4b59-aa9a-3a83f71ef97e', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Cors y Clochydd, Gate Posts', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529464', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (c8c4fb74-6839-44f5-9d7c-4bf7e1016c40)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (36025fc5-29df-438a-9f6c-a4e13ef0eec2)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (64c748a3-ed5c-4b68-a5b5-5f994f625929)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (86bc3e63-9f13-4d07-91e4-0d28307add10)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (df0dc480-55f6-4cfd-98eb-3d5efca207a7)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (f6b7477e-e69f-40ec-9f07-0c715b7eb831)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (735aef92-28b0-47a4-928f-9e980d123ccf)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (9d74dd7a-d089-4346-a721-003b4c6f5dc6)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (224ad721-2b40-4d62-a03a-603d8f22434d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (a08cada7-2dd7-401d-a906-562a137163b6)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (f7daba24-b540-4e12-8472-4e726472f9ae)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (519e2585-5e05-4182-b8af-fe3039212209)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (6d690db2-a4c5-422a-b29f-f0a042b549cf)>, <TileModel: TileMo