  R.P. Sambrook, Trysor, 27 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': 'eccecc4a-98e8-4da1-846c-9f600d4bf5c9', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Cors y Clochydd, Long Hut I', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529466', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (b04b0e60-b2dc-4b8c-b82f-dd8c2bc3a0c6)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (08b55723-d61a-427e-82c9-326e63307125)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (5a33bdd1-2a96-4d87-a70f-9e35a31fb61d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c03d9dd5-6464-40e1-aba7-c5748c134c53)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (668ce634-671e-40d5-aba9-27b5365a6d62)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (09821e76-d9ac-4ec6-8ae8-07eec8dcc139)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (eb5c2df2-7ea6-4f44-a10e-1b758b340aff)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (8296d26b-cc73-4d2a-9b07-dd253631163f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (704b6f35-5de0-4d9e-b830-37b2f13d637d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (deed216c-6115-4149-bdd6-9b499ea7897e)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (cadb5217-8d7c-4531-86cc-9e16db053ab9)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (a29eedc8-a7b2-4173-b0a7-bfd70760489d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (cf876c20-ba71-4bfb-bf10-d4bf8eac8bce)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (9880f214-ca8a-49a0-9a3f-8b75830fc014)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (95b876bd-93a0-4ec6-9b32-1a1fa8b76112)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (cba4c623-0bab-4655-b9a1-e29d95557044)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (7ab66ac4-afe7-46bd-a25a-39ef3e1599df)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (aadedb1e-31e9-4157-b3bb-1ab552edbdd2)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Cors y Clochydd, Long Hut I', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'A two-celled long hut, located on a gentle slope.  The site is largely obscured by thick reed growth, but it measures a little over 