 banks, 1 metre wide and 0.30 metres high.  These would have been the foundations for timber and clay walls. There may have been a levelled yard area to the south of the building, where there appears to be an ephemeral bank running to the west.  R.P. Sambrook, Trysor, 28 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': 'a58eee03-6c1b-4f27-8b9e-6b299f742407', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Waun Clawdd, Long Hut I', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529482', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (f00f48f9-58bf-4b40-8cfd-ea787e2eee81)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (7263ebf8-5f54-4646-80b3-33083e0d4ac1)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (839aecf8-db18-4bb2-b4aa-99b4ee5d6be3)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2a6bfa87-ad43-448f-bede-509ec3b3005f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (4109cc5b-6704-417a-8ce8-42de6e330ed6)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ff3acae8-423a-4bea-a7c0-1f93752d680a)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (25122bea-cdbb-4831-af9c-d5177590730f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (5825f006-6b07-4a6b-bb80-657a346282c7)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (672d7fd8-7482-47d0-895f-ed6a2c2d7299)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (f694d9c0-bd1b-418d-9d3b-405e20f1fb5b)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0beda3f9-8d08-4437-bf94-7cf976486502)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (a6d61122-fbee-46a0-8a4e-2dcd5a06b8cc)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (cb8a85ee-8a95-4316-9e89-4db4eecbdc14)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0ab1ecb9-716c-4d91-8f57-82abbf40f94c)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ade5dcbd-10fa-4853-a787-c49c97640d41)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (9ed69dfa-5e5f-4e2c-9ae4-1435d2cb9c84)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ee87ae9b-05b3-4cd2-9133-7e6331f1a17d)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Waun Clawdd, Long Hut I', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), '