 across a levelled terrace.  These may however be features created by the excavation. Lewis seems to have uncovered evidence of a cottage or long hut here and his site plan shows that it was in the form of a central rectilinear structure, perhaps 10 metres by 4 metres, flanked by secondary structures appended to the north and south sides, all on an east-northeast to west-southwest axis. None of this is apparent at the site today.  Trevor Lewis's plan is reproduced as Figure 5, in his article ?Archaeological investigations in the vicinity of Llanddewi-Brefi and Llanfair-Clydogau?, which was published in Transactions of the Cardiganshire Antiquarian Society - Vol. 5 1927. R.P. Sambrook, Trysor, 28 March 2013", 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'English Description', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'SN6751955535', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f67-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704')}, {'string': 'SN6755', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'SN65NE', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Grid reference taken at centre of site', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'JJH', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('0b5446f8-a00c-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Llanddewi Brefi', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f3d-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Cardiganshire', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f61-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Ceredigion', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f46-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'LONG HUT', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f49-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No Preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f49-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'),