alls of adjacent field enclosures which represent a post-medieval attempt to extend the boundary of farmed land onto the mountain.  The track passes beyond the limits of these now abandoned fields and continues for another 600 metres, turning to the southeast, and eventually terminates just east of the Neolithic chambered cairn, Cerrig y Clochesti (NPRN 529508).  Along much of its course it is a deep gully, apparently eroded over time, and hence difficult to walk along.  The gully is up to 6 metres wide in places.  R.P. Sambrook, Trysor, 28 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': '7dbb61c8-73e6-4ded-87d6-1c42e4c1e7ee', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Banc y Gwyngoed, Trackway', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529507', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (d4d9914c-c939-4a30-9a0e-b393fa8c2a99)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (66c7f451-678c-44a3-89ee-3cac88dd7149)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2e01fc37-934d-40b0-8608-5c11275e937f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (99914fb3-e6c6-482d-84f6-43e5562dc1d7)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (e071fccd-0dff-4731-ba41-cd884a95fc08)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (fb6658d5-c167-4cdd-b5f0-b482bafead75)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0f4e6d67-d058-40f7-b4c7-1ef9b0789016)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (6627c6ef-88b3-467d-86cb-edf51aad0949)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0235b5e3-4eb8-4d4d-96bf-61600244aba2)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (e8ab7876-4de8-43a2-9a90-890919c61b8c)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (b64cb4b9-adc3-489b-a675-726f8b138b24)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (10b2b9e1-0a0a-472e-8cb8-3df1678a200e)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c46c9193-b50a-4a37-8cbc-8b72d7ee39c7)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (e08a4db4-7362-4847-836d-220607a5ad7f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (472117cc-2625-4644-be0a-1a00fc0e1b3b)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (3659c077-e065-4e4d-abd4-f7af29c1f98b)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Banc y Gwyngoed, Trackway', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'This old trackway runs onto the mountain pasture at the northern end of Banc y Gwyngoed via a gate that leads out from enclosed farmland to the north.  The first 135 metres of its course is defined by the drystone boundary walls of adjacent field enclosures which represent a post-medieval attempt to extend the boundary of farmed land onto the mountain.  The track passes beyond the limits of these now abandoned fields and continues for another 600 metres, turning to the southeast, and eventually terminates just east of the Neolithic chambered cairn, Cerrig y Clochesti (NPRN 529508).  Along much of its course it is a deep gully, apparently eroded over time, and hence difficult to walk along.  The gully is up to 6 metres wide in places.  R.P. Sambrook, Trysor, 28 March 2013', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'English Description', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'SN6786956511', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f67-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704')}, {'string': 'SN6756', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'SN65NE', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Grid reference taken at point along linear site', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'JJH', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('0b5446f8-a00c-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Llanddewi Brefi', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f3d-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Cardiganshire', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f61-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional