ion': 'This cairn survives as a circular stone pile, with a hollow at its centre. It is 4 metres in diameter, by 0.40 metres high.  The hollow is 1.25 metres in diameter and 0.60 metres deep. It may be a small ring cairn. It is part of an extensive cairnfield across a level area north and west of Cors y Clochydd, NPRN 529109. R.P. Sambrook, Trysor, 28 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': '3fde0632-3aef-49a3-a03a-a2aefd62f32f', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Cors y Clochydd, Cairn XXI', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529512', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (cc4d60ac-8d58-409d-9337-fce632b961cc)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (12c56d11-7775-48be-a79f-08ab4d3f744d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (1d4b394b-6e1e-487f-bdbd-b0f89f9e1c36)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (b2120a35-dfe8-470a-9cf5-0a1b7e2ec229)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (631cfdc5-e03c-40ca-ae3b-d8bb89433a49)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2d6d5a20-4f3f-44dd-ade1-c3fb4549a003)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (7d451165-cb95-4c70-a3a2-1ee9fd18c58c)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (d5309117-6e7e-4fc4-8b4e-0813c58fa1e8)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (d23bbb36-40a8-4c27-b3ce-24bf45692081)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (36789200-4682-482f-8efd-613c9c55a411)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (a766ed2d-9a64-45ab-9e68-c2525f913842)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0d5f3359-6d3e-4a06-8d4f-14aa7c4df13e)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2e30b57b-65f1-4543-88ae-427aa412e714)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (42abc257-398a-43b2-8138-3a7776c76612)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (55f6bc0b-b942-48fc-89d2-3d860427cbeb)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0bd4c1d6-763a-41d6-9050-f3a068d5badc)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Cors y Clochydd, Cairn XXI', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530