e east-southeast facing slope.  The fan cut into the slope at the northeast end of the platform is discernable, with a bank to its southwest side.  There is however no obvious evidence of a levelled area in front of this cut, and the feature may in fact be natural or the product of quarrying associated with an adjacent structure (NPRN 529538). R.P.Sambrook, Trysor, 26 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': 'bcb5ab01-8fc1-40fb-8934-77df4a0c04d8', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Craig Twrch, Platform II ', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529539', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (5ead4708-7209-46ca-8eb4-218118352899)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (bd9ef857-f418-4379-955f-be4d4781accf)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (52db05c7-fb68-4bd1-8667-11481910dc3d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (69b34b87-aacc-45a3-b981-046ae4804c3d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (1e75475c-3fc5-4f98-9738-6f7fddf3aced)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (7d6604aa-9fcb-48c4-89d7-331b7e746ebc)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (6da30d5c-739d-4cd0-9d86-8a8a16bed55a)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (37187f5c-8edb-46ce-8530-84997dbe2039)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (7db27357-c193-46bc-a257-1c558018cfa6)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (4c3e6771-762c-43e8-ae85-b31a1193f7f3)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (1a66d010-84f7-4f5b-93f3-8f356f5b43dc)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (57042985-d8ff-4848-93f1-f8435b4ab3c6)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (6befc11e-2717-484e-aaa6-6fa9bcc049ae)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c9bef337-36b6-4227-b097-d61e342ec467)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (48b9defd-6696-4ee4-8dbc-c21359e989ef)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (029cccdd-9143-4549-affa-0d834957c193)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (fde9b77e-0e0f-4289-a1c7-6bf282c49544)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Craig Twrch, Platform II ', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisiona