 The site is partly obscured by reed growth around and within the building, but its grassed-over wall bases are clearly visible during the winter months.  R.P.Sambrook, Trysor, 26 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': '149e3470-5842-48e2-b3ff-1e1f93fd22fd', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Craig Twrch, Dwelling', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529546', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (ea1a8a4e-3e05-436d-8df4-fe171f44ddc0)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2a2af084-d756-45cf-a8e6-29115a3267c1)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (24929c53-aa8e-4441-9158-34424437c5b4)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (8afe216a-e2a9-40f3-8cc5-059e91b27c5c)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (735cb310-6c63-4bee-aa8d-c38ea907c233)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c3d6bd2b-62df-4cc3-bfd1-cceb3dae1efe)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2c70a8d8-d339-4021-acfc-6451a58e6363)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (84df961c-46b4-4398-aa49-ab4674a074ba)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (b1299e54-a9f7-449d-b0a5-d34028a7983a)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (53be011e-d4ab-4b96-b326-79a283779880)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (7d5d2992-2d1e-4951-aef9-5b48263a3a3f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (433da534-556b-4b95-9518-1c2eedd5ccb9)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (f7594c85-0976-4550-ac27-0b57239aa334)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (d3008f14-abd2-4a39-91b2-557f6cdb80da)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (880d4cbd-bcc1-4958-8997-a6d739807da3)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ff70fa57-d1cb-4efc-9352-98e4aa805a77)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (cfc322dd-933b-45c0-9803-2ed179096ab1)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (74fb8478-f00b-4cf1-9439-82203a36a97f)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Craig Twrch, Dwelling', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'st