rook, Trysor, 26 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': '01a4ae30-468a-41a6-97cd-00f3a5ff0a11', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Rhysgog Lead Mine, Building', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529588', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (373ac4ee-178b-4ad7-aaa7-334c25f72636)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (62535a56-63f8-40b6-bffd-3644beb586d6)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0dda9b40-8aea-484b-83e0-b27128bee4d8)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (4f883f83-0ed6-4f65-949e-d6a1c4166ba4)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (f7484243-1008-4b6e-bd30-e881eb878422)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c535fa47-59ae-40f4-aec4-4d0bffd15544)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (505eec48-4150-46fa-9d65-691c49192146)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (57c2a9b7-4115-4834-9946-b0b318f52c5f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (bd3dcebc-d997-45fa-a0a4-92ced140a99b)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (01fbfdcd-b46c-4848-941f-073566c4dc84)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (492636ce-aafd-4351-b16e-250a3faf0fee)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (3277b8ef-5fd6-4ec5-8fc4-a74c9c1b3532)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (df899ea1-062a-4ffc-8184-4b0045043cab)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2b20aa7d-8798-4cc8-9446-a483859642f6)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ab26ed5e-484e-4c75-a402-db7561e54a2d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (b1c1ee5c-fef8-430a-9948-ac52d35e81ab)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2aa76f85-1ed9-4cde-a2a1-67a8bc403eb5)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Rhysgog Lead Mine, Building', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'This is the site of a ruined mine building or structure in the Rhysgog lead mine complex.  It lies close to the east of the Nant Rhysgog stream, which has resulted in the eastern side of the structure beginning to