rcahmw_resources'}, 'data': {'displaydescription': 'This triangular feature appears to be a fold, created by constructing an L-shaped bank against the northwestern side of a field boundary wall.  The bank extends some 5 metres northwest out from the wall and then turns southwest and runs back to the wall to create the triangle. The bank has a rounded profile, up to 0.60 metres high and 1 metre wide at base.  R.P.Sambrook, Trysor, 26 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': '7c5a5d83-b107-4f2a-94f2-766b112e71d2', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Craig Curyll, Fold', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529593', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (fdded7bd-f545-4599-8480-8a9121a68ed9)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (e2bf1cd2-2a63-437e-bd0e-54b5b0006671)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (5d796105-d152-4096-a31a-8c8d4219c1f5)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c224897c-5557-4c8f-9227-17655db55341)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (4ad2866f-25a0-49c8-a8aa-b90f784deb30)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (52ceb3a9-926a-441f-a8cc-14db9930d978)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (d40a95b5-2e07-4fe8-a6fa-b0f67c7f4931)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0b589556-3976-4230-934f-b97fb89612b5)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (9c73fd5d-4cd1-4876-acff-bfb5e52f6741)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c2b7daf8-c1f5-43d7-9782-18c173ee6183)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (e8b651d3-5b60-4754-8b37-615ac657f22c)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (5918fecc-d9fe-4159-a4af-a168b1dd909d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (db2c145d-3e25-4f2e-870d-dac2673f19d0)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (15e70ca5-10c1-4ad8-8887-5656bf848e3e)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (1e09bc06-8e53-44af-8157-6cadb109df4d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (920dea22-eb75-41fd-8bb5-4e6771546e3f)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Craig Curyll, Fold', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'stri