n built on top of its southern edge.  A small marker cairn (NPRN 529681) has also been built from the stones of the original monument.  It is impossible to determine how large the cairn was originally, and now only a strip of cairn material survives, 8 metres long by 2 metres wide and up to 0.60 metres high.    R.P. Sambrook, Trysor, 28 March 2013', 'resourceinstanceid': 'd7ea9011-d63d-45d6-94e9-ef1518905ffe', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Bryn Mawr, Cairn', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '529680', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (2930ac0b-5048-4c53-821a-e2d53c1f26b5)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (1d61e88b-17b8-48fb-82ec-e43ecf9b35b9)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (b5ba7184-29d7-4f76-a0f0-5e824775ca98)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (6e536a95-0bd2-492f-820d-8ed4c554e462)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (5b332ae1-b42b-44d4-9df7-b4be88275e0a)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2720fc1a-01b1-4764-bdfc-7a63e52872f7)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (e0faa566-584c-45c6-a77b-92cae182e252)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (1dc60b26-2c06-4918-a051-37e13ee9ac5e)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (1f5148f5-5e8f-4220-901a-e2cdfbe01bbd)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (42523ddc-3e2c-4921-ba2a-ffc721358aac)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (1603f4ea-7b61-468b-a2fb-28fee0347131)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (6c579fd9-0d64-42a4-99ea-8b66a7038fbc)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c768c9fa-0a01-4705-9ae3-16a5cad75601)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (6700b3bf-3df5-44c4-9d48-0e5717972123)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (4d0c834d-6e92-45bc-87c8-3296a222695a)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ef5732e8-fa38-4984-a055-a5c7b1e8f101)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Bryn Mawr, Cairn', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': Fal