 Craig Curyll, turning southeast to follow the ridge line, before eventually dropping back down the valley to end at the stream bank higher up the valley.  It was presumably associated with Rhysgog Uchaf, a now ruined dwelling which lies in a separate field attached to the western side of this parcel.  R.P.Sambrook, Trysor, 26 March 2013', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'English Description', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'SN6816154069', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f67-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704')}, {'string': 'SN6854', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'SN65SE', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Grid reference taken at centre of site', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'RPS', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('0b5446f8-a00c-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Llanddewi Brefi', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f3d-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Cardiganshire', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f61-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Ceredigion', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f46-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'BANK (EARTHWORK)', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f49-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No Preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f49-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Not Applicable', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f49-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': '12A', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f55-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Not Applicable', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f55-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'N