between this junction, a trackway (feature 530035) cuts across the current feature exposing a drystone wall which is likely to continue underneath the remainder of this feature. Two additional breaches have been made to the bank near its northwest end, one by a fork of the trackway (530035) and again 6m to the southwest. It is depicted on the 1889 25 inch OS map. T. Burke-Davies, ArcHeritage, 17 May 2012.', 'resourceinstanceid': 'd87d9722-0e76-43fa-8e52-b70d732583c6', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Dol-y-Moch-Uchaf, Bank VI', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '530040', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (df38c78e-74cb-47d6-bca7-fc248e2f1bd7)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (1147d76d-8d01-46f7-b992-233fb9aff09e)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (66a8b166-18e5-4ca7-aca1-981da8b07c6e)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (72b225bf-907f-41c5-b651-3d30de272aa8)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (7b801731-c841-486b-9639-aa667b8e155a)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (a7f726dd-a2e7-4574-8fa7-5ef6f318c930)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (adbf5e58-9bcb-4d44-9a06-ffe3fcffac97)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (24d8c1ba-b680-47cf-aadb-9483678f9529)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (48166dec-0bff-4b7d-8b64-63d4da1051c0)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2962caa9-acc8-4225-a759-44c93367811d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ce51afae-6a04-4889-89cd-92e6035e4b61)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (847d98cc-b40b-4a33-8ee6-bca072547560)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (8d326150-98ed-41e7-bde8-83c75eea7553)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (d22a66ef-f7c7-42ec-b360-f5d0d4c5296b)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (3fd5d2be-009e-41ba-b5f9-ac00f517ab9f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (b7acb5c3-f0cc-456a-b029-99e2d23799cd)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'Dol-y-Moch-Uchaf, Bank VI', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No preference', 'no