ll, along its southeast wall. The northeast cell is a square chamber measuring approximately 5m x 5m, with an opening to another compartment at its southern corner, and an opening to enclosure 530059 near the north corner. The central cell is a sub-rectangular chamber, approximately 10m x 5m, with a sheep-crawl to the southwest compartment in the middle of its southwest wall. The southwest cell is a sub-rectangular chamber, approximately 2m x 5m, with a sheep-crawl to the open pasture on the southeast wall. It is depicted on the 1901 25 inch OS map. T. Burke-Davies, ArcHeritage, 18 May 2012.', 'resourceinstanceid': '980b1af1-ceb9-4042-81a5-d2d99675cec4', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'Ffridd Dalcen, Sheep Fold I', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '530058', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (ae689724-980d-41be-a576-19346786f0e2)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (32a3d56b-1049-4fc1-bf10-e033942a5cfc)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (820785b6-5154-4b45-bb47-903484ecc50f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ba198006-8023-42a7-8d8e-774bf26b040a)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (f33e05c8-354f-4085-b9a5-6c63508e531d)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (25bad478-04e4-4be2-89f6-05ee43697011)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (964d31c0-6c94-4043-92fb-9835720c23f2)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (9a9250a9-22f8-4543-b442-385854519397)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (aeb03bea-932f-4400-9e72-d8f8989dcb19)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (021795c6-06e4-4e39-bbc5-32b02c5964e2)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (13823063-3107-490e-9f9e-a026ae7ba307)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (da8654b8-b2cd-4acb-b129-edbd74d5059e)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (d18aa527-02d9-471d-b432-56beffbbbc32)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (fbc7608f-c0d2-4198-9737-17096fd3238f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (06ac026a-2506-43ca-bbac-42166a8671a4)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0ae64d52-1537-499