restry Commission land to the south of the road and is incorporated into the Forestry Commission boundary to the north, with the last 20m of the north end continuing north of the Forestry Commission boundary and decreasing to approximately 0.2m in height before ending. A sheep crawl is built into the wall 40m north from the road. A. Farrington-McCabe, ArcHeritage, 17 May 2012.', 'resourceinstanceid': '283ab7b6-b7fe-4560-b003-23b3c81891bd', 'graph_id': '60120f3c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704', 'map_popup': 'No preference', 'displayname': 'West of Bwlch Pen-y-Feidiog, Boundary Wall I', 'root_ontology_class': 'http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing', 'legacyid': '530155', 'tiles': [<TileModel: TileModel object (c11d061a-f41e-4330-88eb-e622f5d356d0)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (2de4deee-bceb-4b43-8cd6-46a4597e89d4)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (55e9bd32-0dd2-48da-ae2f-9aff8f9f81bf)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (deda5c1c-4405-4222-bac6-49d70c2c71ca)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (67799a67-2ac1-4363-b275-df59801a886f)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (d98e4332-a5fd-4435-9f82-9fa5003d7613)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (32ae482a-ffe2-4a42-a6bb-77d56ae991be)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c9067932-dd7b-446c-ac62-9d7ea8e985fe)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (6251377d-5bc4-4dba-a8e8-b62e46501ad7)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (0fafe2bd-56ce-4915-9180-c54ec399298b)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (197d05f9-48df-4a0f-944a-586b999c7eb9)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (77e53d25-bea4-48f8-aef9-e863fd3a5fd1)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (c7f09d19-7d78-41a6-8c7b-9e14b44bd267)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ae656281-c839-4571-9742-2701808851ee)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (56c50b65-7cbb-4b13-8ec7-ee33c53d3c1b)>, <TileModel: TileModel object (ab7b389d-5414-402d-b245-5d053f4f4d06)>], 'strings': [{'string': 'West of Bwlch Pen-y-Feidiog, Boundary Wall I', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No preference', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f4c-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'A drystone boundary wall, approximately 300m in length, 0.75m in width, with height ranging between 1.5m at its maximum to its 0.5m at its lowest. The wall remains substantially intact, aligned north to south and running upslope from the main road. A 15m long section is also visible on Forestry Commission land to the south of the road and is incorporated into the Forestry Commission boundary to the north, with the last 20m of the north end continuing north of the Forestry Commission boundary and decreasing to approximately 0.2m in height before ending. A sheep crawl is built into the wall 40m north from the road. A. Farrington-McCabe, ArcHeritage, 17 May 2012.', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'English Description', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'SH7796033480', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f67-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704')}, {'string': 'SH7733', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'SH73SE', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Grid reference taken at point along linear site', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('688529e4-9ff5-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'AFM', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('0b5446f8-a00c-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Trawsfynydd', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f3d-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Merioneth', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f61-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'Gwynedd', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f46-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'FIELD BOUNDARY', 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f49-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'provisional': False}, {'string': 'No Preference', '