l gardens over the 18th-19th century kitchen garden and orchard. Although promotional literature for the site still (2002)  claims this garden has its origins in the 16th century, this claim is currently unsupported either archaeologically or historically.        <br>\nC.S.Briggs 13.07.05<br>\n", '60120f70-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': '7a82d020-e0f5-4459-b07f-d1e634547fa1'}, 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'sortorder': 0, 'provisionaledits': None}, {'tileid': '8d9ab71a-a81d-4567-947c-cac0bf5d4717', 'resourceinstance_id': UUID('5a0b7254-d150-4160-9b90-96bd60c85186'), 'parenttile_id': None, 'data': {}, 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f40-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'sortorder': 0, 'provisionaledits': None}, {'tileid': '07f43add-9245-4544-a203-6c2d8a47af98', 'resourceinstance_id': UUID('5a0b7254-d150-4160-9b90-96bd60c85186'), 'parenttile_id': UUID('8d9ab71a-a81d-4567-947c-cac0bf5d4717'), 'data': {'60120f6a-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': None, '60120f77-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': {'type': 'FeatureCollection', 'features': [{'id': '9ba859b7-2770-4b92-9c91-26c59fc326eb', 'type': 'Feature', 'geometry': {'type': 'Point', 'coordinates': [-4.0636945, 51.879164]}, 'properties': {}}]}}, 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f6a-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'sortorder': 0, 'provisionaledits': None}, {'tileid': '2bbbcd9c-1a89-469e-8860-82976cd635c2', 'resourceinstance_id': UUID('5a0b7254-d150-4160-9b90-96bd60c85186'), 'parenttile_id': UUID('8d9ab71a-a81d-4567-947c-cac0bf5d4717'), 'data': {'60120f67-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': None, '60120f79-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': 'SN5804522080'}, 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f67-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'sortorder': 0, 'provisionaledits': None}, {'tileid': '05145f7a-4c2c-49f1-8434-bd8b1cbef38f', 'resourceinstance_id': UUID('5a0b7254-d150-4160-9b90-96bd60c85186'), 'parenttile_id': None, 'data': {'084fae54-9ff6-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': 'SN5822', '20bd6de6-9ff6-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': 'SN52SE', '688529e4-9ff5-11ea