glass conservatory/orangery, rebuilt during the'90s.<br>\n<br>\nBeyond and S are the larches, and a moss house, sadly derelicted since c 1994. <br>\n<br>\nThe third and final component is the most southern, which abuts the main road (A40). This is a fine piece of woodland set around the old Llanspyddid Church and several estate buildings. <br>\n<br>\nC.S.Briggs 06.12.05", '60120f70-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': '7a82d020-e0f5-4459-b07f-d1e634547fa1'}, 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f43-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'sortorder': 0, 'provisionaledits': None}, {'tileid': '507b4727-ce93-4591-a826-be019be2a266', 'resourceinstance_id': UUID('b169f5cf-8857-4815-912e-11f002388a9d'), 'parenttile_id': None, 'data': {}, 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f40-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'sortorder': 0, 'provisionaledits': None}, {'tileid': 'e8d8f626-878e-4ba1-bbe2-628d61ad9f01', 'resourceinstance_id': UUID('b169f5cf-8857-4815-912e-11f002388a9d'), 'parenttile_id': UUID('507b4727-ce93-4591-a826-be019be2a266'), 'data': {'60120f6a-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': None, '60120f77-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': {'type': 'FeatureCollection', 'features': [{'id': '33828771-bb62-436f-969a-36b8797c8db7', 'type': 'Feature', 'geometry': {'type': 'Point', 'coordinates': [-3.4976686, 51.94768]}, 'properties': {}}]}}, 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f6a-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'sortorder': 0, 'provisionaledits': None}, {'tileid': 'c04de0b2-e11c-400a-badb-2465f3ee5158', 'resourceinstance_id': UUID('b169f5cf-8857-4815-912e-11f002388a9d'), 'parenttile_id': UUID('507b4727-ce93-4591-a826-be019be2a266'), 'data': {'60120f67-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': None, '60120f79-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': 'SN9716128747'}, 'nodegroup_id': UUID('60120f67-9ff2-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704'), 'sortorder': 0, 'provisionaledits': None}, {'tileid': '57a2d97e-3535-44ce-8654-51101a2f339a', 'resourceinstance_id': UUID('b169f5cf-8857-4815-912e-11f002388a9d'), 'parenttile_id': None, 'data': {'084fae54-9ff6-11ea-a530-000d3a86d704': 'SN